    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE ASSOCIATION OF PROFESSIONALBANKERS -SRI LANKA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      238.85,
      401.91,
      310.19
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cAssociation of Professional Bankers - Sri Lanka\u201d hasheretofore been formed for the purpose of effectually carryingout and accomplishing all objects and matters connectedwith the said Association according to the rules agreed to byits members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      322.85,
      401.9,
      382.19
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and accomplished the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and will be for the public advantage to grantthe application :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      394.85,
      401.9,
      418.19
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      430.85,
      401.85,
      466.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Association ofProfessional Bankers - Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      475.01,
      401.91,
      606.35
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of theAssociation of Professional Bankers - Sri Lanka (hereinafterreferred to as \u201cthe Association\u201d) and such other persons whoshall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporationhereby constituted, shall be a body corporate with perpetualsuccession, under the name and style of the \u201cAssociation ofProfessional Bankers - Sri Lanka\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be suedin all court with full power and authority to have and to use acommon seal and to change or alter the same at its will and pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      614.93,
      401.87,
      638.27
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      646.85,
      401.85,
      670.19
    ],
    "text": "(a) to assist to maintan and develop a sound bankingstructure in Sri Lanka ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
